And what did he find?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.380
He found that viewers
rated slightly imperfect

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:59.060
AI food images as
significantly more uncanny and

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.220
less pleasant than either
obviously fake cartoonish

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:05.080
food or highly realistic
genuine photographs.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:06.880
Okay, I think I see where this is going.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.280
If I see an illustration of a
