00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.080
True.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.800
But throughout human history, eating
the wrong thing, like something rotten,

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:48.880
contaminated or poisonous,
that was a death sentence.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.220
Ah, of course.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.340
So it's a defense mechanism.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.700
It's a survival trait.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.300
It's like a biological check engine
light hardwired into our brains.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:00.800
If you are foraging in the woods and you see
