00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.540
No, definitely not.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.140
Our brains scream poison, contamination.

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.960
Do not put that in your body.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.640
That is an excellent analogy.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.580
We have evolved a hypersensitive disgust

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.740
mechanism to guard against
ingesting pathogens.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:24.440
So, when we see an AI image
