00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:27.320
or the texture of the meat
looks like stitched leather,

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:30.740
it bypasses our logical
understanding that it's just a bad

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:33.980
digital image and directly triggers
that ancient alarm system.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.220
It thinks it's a pathogen.

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:36.380
Exactly.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:38.960
Diel connects this to a
